	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Single Cell and Spatial Analysis of Human Squamous Cell Carcinoma [WES]</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">To define the cellular composition and spatial architecture of the tumor micoenvironment, we combined single-cell RNA-sequencing, spatial transcriptomics, and multiplexed ion-beam imaging from 10 patient cutaneous squamous cell carcinoma tumors and site-matched normal skin</Item>
